 r own plan alongside\, such as a core timelapse on a second tripod.\nPrior
 ity: Booked\n\nWHEN (Sydney time)\nNight of Sat 03 Apr into Sun 04 Apr 202
 7.\nShoot window: 23:15 to 02:25 (core between 8° and 60° high\, sky ful
