 rvalometer\, warm layers\, boots with ankle support\, water\, snacks\, ins
 ect repellent.\n- Runs in cloud. Postponed only for heavy rain or storms. 
 The organiser's reserve date is Sat 10 Apr\, your Bombo Headland night. De
 cide early which one wins if it moves.\n- Daylight saving ends at 03:00 th
 is night and clocks go back to 02:00. The event ends before the change. Ev
 ery time in this event is AEDT.\n- Roughly 1 h 30 min drive north of Neutr
 al Bay.\n\nVERIFY BEFORE YOU GO\nTPE Web (camera pin\, subject pin and tim
